id: SAVE20-3
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: broken_histories
target: crates/core/src/history_open.rs
find:         refuse(LoadReason::ReplayMismatch)
replace:         view_only(LoadReason::ReplayDiverged)
expect-fail: all_seven_broken_histories_are_refused_with_the_fixed_code
note: 入力の列の書き換え（B-1）を「開かない」ではなく表示だけに倒す
